@startuml optimizetool-structure
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #496A88
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF5FB
skinparam classBorderColor #496A88
skinparam packageBorderColor #8AA4BC
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members
hide circle
set separator none
title OptimizeTool 구조

package "MeshOptimization (Runtime)" {
  class "MeshCombiner\nBackfaceCullMeshBaker" as MeshComponents {
    설정·씬 출력 상태·원본 Mesh 기록
  }
  class MeshBuildSettings {
    빌드 옵션 검증, 각도·Occlusion 규칙
  }
}

package "MeshOptimization.Editor" {
  class MeshToolCommands {
    BuildMeshes · CombineAndSaveMeshes · RestoreSources
    BakeBackfaces · RestoreOriginalMeshes (확장 메서드)
  }
  class MeshProcessing {
    공개 메시 연산, 인자 검사 후 위임
  }
  class MeshBuildPipeline {
    입력 검증·컬링·Material별 결합
  }
  class MeshRendererSettings {
    Renderer 설정 검사·비교·적용
  }
  class MeshGeometry {
    기하 연산, Backface 판정(카메라·방향)
  }
  class MeshOcclusion {
    Collider Raycast 가림 판정
  }
  class MeshSceneOutput {
    결과 오브젝트·원본 Renderer 기록
  }
  class MeshSceneEdit {
    Edit Mode Undo · Play Mode 직접 복원
  }
  class MeshAssetTransaction {
    GUID 유지 저장·복원
  }
}

package "PhysicsRecording (Runtime)" {
  class PhysicsRecorder {
    Start · Stop · Cancel · Result
    표본 간격 · 새 Rigidbody track
  }
  class PhysicsTake {
    track별 관찰값, 숨김 구간
  }
  interface IPhysicsRecordingExporter {
    검증·리로드 잠금·저장
  }
  class PhysicsRecordingReference {
    축약 전 관찰값 (선택 저장)
  }
  class "PhysicsClipFormat\nPhysicsRecordingMetrics" as PhysicsOutputInfo {
    LegacyPrefab · Generic, Result.Metrics
  }
  class PhysicsPlaybackPolicy {
    재생 오브젝트 규칙·검증
  }
}

package "PhysicsRecording.Editor" {
  class PhysicsRecordingEditorExporter {
    [InitializeOnLoad] 등록
  }
  class PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter {
    clip·(Legacy) prefab·reference 트랜잭션
  }
  class PhysicsClipBuilder {
    키 축약·Legacy/Generic 클립·Metrics
  }
  class PhysicsPlaybackStripper {
    복제본의 물리·스크립트 제거
  }
}

package "OptimizeTool.Editor (공용)" {
  class AssetFileTransaction {
    경로 규칙·폴더·덮어쓰기·복원
  }
}

package "Benchmark · Benchmark.Editor (Dev)" {
  class "OptimizeToolPerformanceBenchmark\nOptimizeToolScaleWorkload" as Benchmark {
    Player·Editor 계측, 규모 씬
  }
  class "OptimizeToolScaleBuilder\nOptimizeToolBenchmarkEditor" as BenchmarkEditor {
    규모 씬 생성, 벤치마크 빌드
  }
}

MeshToolCommands ..> MeshComponents : 설정 읽기
MeshComponents ..> MeshBuildSettings : CreateSettings
MeshToolCommands --> MeshBuildPipeline
MeshToolCommands --> MeshGeometry : Backface 베이크
MeshProcessing --> MeshGeometry
MeshProcessing --> MeshOcclusion
MeshBuildPipeline ..> MeshBuildSettings
MeshBuildPipeline --> MeshGeometry
MeshBuildPipeline --> MeshOcclusion
MeshBuildPipeline --> MeshRendererSettings : 입력 검사
MeshSceneOutput --> MeshRendererSettings : ApplyTo
MeshToolCommands --> MeshSceneOutput
MeshSceneOutput --> MeshSceneEdit
MeshToolCommands --> MeshAssetTransaction
MeshAssetTransaction --> AssetFileTransaction

PhysicsRecorder --> PhysicsTake : 스텝 캡처
PhysicsRecorder --> IPhysicsRecordingExporter
PhysicsRecorder ..> PhysicsOutputInfo
PhysicsRecordingEditorExporter ..|> IPhysicsRecordingExporter
PhysicsRecordingEditorExporter --> PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter
PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter --> PhysicsClipBuilder
PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter --> PhysicsPlaybackStripper
PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter --> PhysicsPlaybackPolicy : Validate
PhysicsPlaybackStripper ..> PhysicsPlaybackPolicy : IsStripped
PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter ..> PhysicsRecordingReference : 선택 저장
PhysicsRecordingAssetWriter --> AssetFileTransaction

BenchmarkEditor --> MeshBuildPipeline
BenchmarkEditor --> MeshAssetTransaction
BenchmarkEditor ..> Benchmark : 씬 구성·빌드

note bottom of AssetFileTransaction
Mesh 최적화와 Physics Recorder는 서로 참조하지 않습니다.
옮길 때는 Script/Shared와 필요한 시스템 폴더만 복사합니다.
Dev 벤치마크는 OPTIMIZETOOL_BENCHMARK를 정의한 Player에만 들어갑니다.
end note
@enduml
